@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 220
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
hide circle
hide empty members
package "诊后要求的提出、发布及跟进" as R {
' @reference patient
class "患者" as patient_r <<entity>>
' @reference visit
class "就诊" as visit_r <<entity>>
' @reference plan_version
class "方案版本" as plan_r <<entity>>
class "诊后要求" as followup_requirement <<entity>> {
 类型、目的、目标起止日期
 是否需临床评估、负责前台
 要求状态、下次联系日期
 发布及变更依据、完成或撤销人和时间
 --
 +核对患者与诊疗来源()
 +暂存或发布要求()
 +调整未完成要求(原因)
 +撤销要求(牙医依据)
 +安排继续跟进(日期与责任人)
 +核对目的达成及完成依据()
}
patient_r "1" -- "0..*" followup_requirement
visit_r "0..1" -- "0..*" followup_requirement
plan_r "0..1" -- "0..*" followup_requirement
patient_r -[hidden]right- visit_r
visit_r -[hidden]right- plan_r
note bottom of followup_requirement
来源就诊或方案版本至少一项，均属本患者。
发布仅产生待办；未联系、拒绝、未到不自动完成。
调整及撤销保留原历史，不直接取消既有预约。
end note
}
package "前台联系与成功预约关联" as C {
' @reference followup_requirement
class "诊后要求" as requirement_c <<entity>>
' @reference appointment
class "预约" as appointment_c <<entity>>
class "联系经历" as contact_history <<entity>> {
 实际方式、时间、前台
 沟通事实、结果、下次联系日
 --
 +记录实际联系结果()
 +核对成功预约归属()
 +关联既有成功预约()
 +记录继续联系(日期)
}
requirement_c "1" -- "0..*" contact_history
appointment_c "0..1" -- "0..*" contact_history
requirement_c -[hidden]right- appointment_c
note bottom of contact_history
实际联系、预约、到诊和评估分别记录。
预约失败仍保存联系；不自动建预约。
需评估交牙医；免评估完成仍核对真实目的达成。
end note
}
package "牙医评估与完成条件" as A {
' @reference followup_requirement
class "诊后要求" as requirement_a <<entity>>
' @reference visit
class "就诊" as visit_a <<entity>>
class "临床评估" as clinical_assessment <<entity>> {
 到诊检查或远程沟通、时间、牙医
 结论、意见、来源及局限
 下次日期、跟进责任人
 --
 +核对评估方式与实际依据()
 +追加实际评估()
 +判断原目的是否达到()
 +记录继续跟进(日期与责任人)
}
requirement_a "1" -- "0..*" clinical_assessment
visit_a "0..1" -- "0..*" clinical_assessment
requirement_a -[hidden]right- visit_a
note bottom of clinical_assessment
目的达到且评估完整才完成，评估与完成共同保存。
远程信息不足则安排到诊；继续跟进有日期及责任人。
已有安排待到诊或评估，否则转待联系。
end note
}
@enduml
